WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:02.490
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:05.580
Check it!

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.760
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.910
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:33.790
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.460
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.120
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.530
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:50.230
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.570
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:56.070
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.380
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.410
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.950
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:05.750
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.390
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:11.490
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.990
Everybody, loosey

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.500
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.900
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:25.360
Fly up, angel

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:54.000
Then he got all misty-eyed
when I told him we're through!

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.340
He yelled at me, saying he
bought everything I wanted!

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:03.110
Even though I pawned it all for money!

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:07.250
Then he asked what I hated
about him, so I said everything.

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:12.680
Things got bad! He suddenly
turned into a creepy stalker!

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:15.690
Middle-aged guys are so lame.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:19.550
It's like, "Look at yourself
in the mirror everyday!"

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:25.120
Yeah! I'll bring you along next time!

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:29.700
It's totally fun! His place is the best!

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:33.300
Yeah. Yeah. Later! Bye bye!

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:50.040
"2050 Ethnic Food Festival"

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:01.060
Too bad Ichimonji-<i>kun</i> didn't come too.

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:05.930
Yeah! His dad's visiting Tokyo
today, so I guess he couldn't.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:09.390
Oh, really? Hey! Look at that!

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:25.910
This looks delicious!

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:32.320
What is this?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.560
How about some of these?

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:50.370
Wow! You can eat
anything that's edible!

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:51.600
Yeah!

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:53.610
That was fun!

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:57.150
Plus I learned so much.
I'm glad we came!

00:04:57.150 --> 00:05:01.590
Really? Then I'm glad I invited you!

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:08.530
<i>Normal girls sure are nice...!</i>

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:12.200
I've been worried.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:16.640
You skip class a lot lately,
and you're often absent-minded.

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:20.900
I was concerned something
might be bothering you...

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:25.910
I suppose you could say so...

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:29.850
You can talk to me
about it if you'd like!

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:33.190
As our group's leader,
I can't ignore you!

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:36.360
Because you're the group leader?
Is that all?!

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:39.130
If you were to mess up
during a group project,

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:41.630
everyone would be held accountable.

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:44.650
Oh, yeah. I guess so...

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:48.540
But after seeing you just now,
I feel relieved.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.600
You examined all the food seriously,

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:53.640
and I got the feeling you
haven't lost your enthusiasm.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.010
Of course not.

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:59.210
My dream is to study overseas
and become a top patissier.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:06.050
Is this a shortcut?

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:10.960
Don't be afraid, there aren't any ghosts.
I go this way all the time.

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:16.400
Say, have you heard about the
giant Man-Crow in Ikebukuro?

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:18.550
Man-Crow?

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:22.940
They say a crow about the size
of a person abducts girls.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:26.310
I heard that a lot of people
have already gone missing.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:30.210
Yeah, right! This isn't
TV or the movies!

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:44.920
It couldn't be...

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:52.030
Tachibana-<i>kun</i>...

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:08.910
--The Man-Crow!
--Kazami-<i>san</i>! This way!

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.880
Darn you...!

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:24.230
Tachibana-<i>kun</i>!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.130
Kazami-<i>san</i>!

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:29.290
Tachibana-<i>kun</i>!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:40.840
Please believe me! It's the truth!
It was about this big and--

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.100
I'm not lying!

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:57.530
You sure you're not crazy?

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:01.520
As if we'd believe such a lame story!

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:04.670
It seems such things <i>have</i> happened.

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:10.800
But only local legend sites or
occult message boards talk about it.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:20.620
Where's Sei-<i>san</i>?!
Surely she'd believe me!

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:26.790
Too bad! She left to get
ready for our next job.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:29.000
Say, Kyohei-<i>oniichan</i>!

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:32.770
Since you're already here,
make us something yummy!

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:35.360
This isn't the time for that!

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:38.330
This was in Ikebukuro?

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:41.470
Lead the way, Part-timer!

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:42.510
Seriously?!

00:08:42.510 --> 00:08:45.380
Don't tell me you're actually going?!

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:48.250
Wait, Jo!

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.520
Thank you!

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:52.490
I said wait!

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:55.680
--Let's go, Part-timer!
--Right!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:04.090
You don't want Jo being all
alone with someone else, do you?

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:29.060
If anything happens to
Kazami-<i>san</i>, I'm responsible!

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:31.390
We have to find her right away...!

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:32.880
Don't get anxious!

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:49.700
Wait! It's just me!

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.410
I came along!

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:55.650
I told you to stay behind.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:10:00.120
I really wanted to see
this huge crow of his!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:04.350
Don't worry! It's not like
I get caught all the time!

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:10.530
Yikes. You don't need to get that mad.

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:11.500
Don't move!

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:18.930
What the...?!

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:31.040
No way! How can it be so big?!

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:36.420
Seems it needs food!

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:40.820
Don't shoot! We have to
ask it where Kazami-<i>san</i> is!

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:42.760
Ask <i>that</i> thing?!

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:47.960
Jo! Here they come!

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:17.430
Meg! Run!

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:20.730
Not again!

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:22.930
Get outta my way...!

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:55.030
No! Let go! I don't
like this! Help me, Jo!

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:57.130
I told you so!

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:28.070
What?!

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:31.600
It's me. About that bodyguard job...

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:34.630
Save it! Meg's been abducted!

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:39.310
There's a huge crow flying
Southeast from Ikebukuro.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:41.210
Have Amy search for its destination!

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:43.440
Hold on.

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:46.990
I know I told you
about this beforehand.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:52.060
Our client is currently in the air,
so I'll have him land near you.

00:12:52.060 --> 00:12:57.960
He's received a death threat,
so w<i>e must</i> protect him at all costs.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:01.630
Forget about him! Meg comes first!

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:06.130
We'll locate her from here.
You guard our client in the meantime.

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:09.180
We'll contact you the
minute we find her.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:13.650
So just do as I say until then.
That's the agreement!

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:15.740
Are you giving me an order?!

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:21.990
I told you! A human-sized
crow just kidnapped Meg!

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:24.260
This is more important!

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:28.260
I haven't forgotten.
But I'll look for Meg.

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:31.260
You protect Bailan's customer.

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:32.230
Got that?

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.240
Be at the landing point
within 20 minutes.

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:39.500
we're on our way there as well.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.700
Landing point?

00:13:43.140 --> 00:13:44.270
Come with me!

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:54.450
Well, Amy?

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:59.390
I told them to wear their
Nav-Systems even when not working!

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:03.620
I don't see anything like it in
the air. Maybe it landed somewhere.

00:14:06.230 --> 00:14:08.900
What a bunch of boneheads!

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:13.340
I should've implanted them with
them while they were sleeping!

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:18.310
One minute, twenty seconds late.

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:21.680
We made it, didn't we? Where's Meg?

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:24.310
Amy's looking for her.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.090
Um, Sei-<i>san</i>...

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:33.130
Please find her somehow!
I'm sure Kazami-<i>san</i> is with her!

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:36.700
Don't worry. I'll mobilize
everyone in the organization

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:40.370
and have them search all of Tokyo.
I'm sure they'll turn up.

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:42.160
Organization...?

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:05.120
So you're the lady from
the Japanese branch?

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:09.060
Yes. Though I'm technically
commander of a detached force.

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:12.330
Have you acquired the glowing brain?

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:16.000
If the reports are true,
then it's incredible.

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.640
Who's he?

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:20.310
A new member. He's only temporary.

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:21.200
Sei!

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.810
Hurry! Inside the trailer!

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:36.280
Run!

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:39.620
Stop! Stay away from it!

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:51.570
Part-timer! Get him outta here!

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:00.200
Look out!

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:22.570
Are you alright...?

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:29.200
This is what it's after!

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:31.870
What is it?

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:36.480
What the...?!

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:40.020
A human body is the
safest hiding place!

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:42.520
Hiding place for what?!

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:43.420
Get down!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.700
Shoot it! Jo!

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:52.650
To think Meg's abductor was
the issuer of the death threat...

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.700
It <i>is</i> a safe hiding spot.

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:06.000
For what? What was I injected with?!

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.740
An experimental nanobot.

00:18:09.740 --> 00:18:11.610
Nanobot?

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:18.280
Known as the NI-50, it's a
micron-sized mechanical murder weapon.

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:22.920
Once someone is injected with one,
they'll die in six hours.

00:18:22.920 --> 00:18:24.620
Six hours?!

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:28.430
<i>That's</i> what was inside that case?!

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:32.760
So that crow does more
than kidnap girls?!

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:36.530
Someone's obviously controlling it!

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:41.270
At any rate, you'll need surgery.

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:44.680
With Bailan's technology,
it <i>can</i> be removed.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.580
I'll survive?!

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:49.550
Yes. Though it will take some time.

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:54.290
--It's back!
--Did it forget something?!

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:04.860
"Hand over the NI-50 at once.

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:08.230
We will exchange your friend for it."

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:19.370
Meg!

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:26.550
--Don't tell me that's--
--Looks like Tokyo Tower!

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:40.330
What are you doing, Jo-<i>san</i>?

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.600
Stop, Jo!

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.400
What's going on?

00:19:47.570 --> 00:19:50.110
Step away from Kyohei-<i>kun</i>!

00:19:50.110 --> 00:19:53.410
The Bailan team will recover the NI-50.

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:55.680
Doing so will let him survive!

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:58.280
Are you just gonna let Meg die?!

00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:01.250
We'll think of another
way to rescue Meg!

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:03.220
Just stop this foolishness!

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:22.610
Come on!

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:24.970
Stop! Jo!

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:43.100
I need you so I can fight that damn crow.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:45.190
You're with me for a while.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:49.630
Try to run away and I'll kill you.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:56.740
Attention all Tokyo members of Bailan.

00:20:56.740 --> 00:21:00.800
Use whatever means available
to capture Tachibana Kyohei.

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:06.450
One person is aiding in his escape.

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.720
She's an armed bounty hunter.

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:12.490
Use any means necessary to stop her.

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:29.540
Six hours until the NI-50 activates...

00:21:31.710 --> 00:21:32.950
Foolish girl.

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:38.280
Do you think you can
defy us and live, Jo?

00:21:57.510 --> 00:22:05.180
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:05.180 --> 00:22:12.820
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:12.820 --> 00:22:20.530
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:20.530 --> 00:22:29.910
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:36.450
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:45.460
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:52.880
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:18.760
<i>Traps set all over the late-night
metropolis attack with a snarl!</i>

00:23:18.760 --> 00:23:20.690
<i>Can you escape them, Jo?!</i>

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:26.130
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Scarred Fugitives"
